  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Climate Promise Project-From Pledge to Impact-Belarus</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Climate Promise project &#x2018;From Pledge to Impact&#x2019; shall further build political commitment and national ownership for the NDC and opens possibilities for more coordinated and systemic engagement with potential donors and partners. The project is aligned with the Climate Promise Framework, and its main pillars. This project addresses one Global Outcome: Global Outcome 2: Amplifying Ambition: Countries have established long-term net-zero and climate resilient development pathways aligned with the goals of the Paris Agreement.</narrative>
  </description>
